==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~6.67 seconds<sup>90f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witches]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witches]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witches]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**7 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 20~20.67 seconds<sup>600f~620f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 20~20.67 seconds<sup>600f~620f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. If you're able to beat [[Moon (Empire of Cats)#Chapter 2|Chapter 2 Moon]], you will be able to beat this level as well.

